# Added: 2026-04-24 (worker-service trivy gate — run 24890086236)
# CVE-2026-31532 — kernel: can: raw: fix ro->uniq use-after-free in raw_rcv().
# Same class as the linux-libc-dev 6.12.74-2 entries above: Debian kernel
# userspace headers only, status=affected, no Debian fix published.
# Impact: None — the CAN (Controller Area Network) raw socket subsystem is
# automotive/industrial bus networking and is never invoked by Meshant
# container workloads (data hub / API / worker / ingestion). Containers use
# the host kernel, so the vulnerable kernel code path in the package is
# never executed.
# Review by: 2026-05-24.
CVE-2026-31532
